25. What is upstream/downstream job?
✅ Upstream vs Downstream Job in Jenkins (Simple Explanation + Example)

Upstream Job
The job that starts or triggers another job

Downstream Job
The job that gets triggered by another job

✅ Simple Real Example (Production Style)
Scenario:
You have 3 jobs in your pipeline:

Build Job
Test Job
Deploy Job

🔹 Flow
Build Job → triggers → Test Job
Test Job → triggers → Deploy Job


🔹 Mapping
Build Job = Upstream of Test Job
Test Job = Downstream of Build Job

Test Job = Upstream of Deploy Job
Deploy Job = Downstream of Test Job


26. What is post block?
