30. What is parallel execution?
Parallel execution in Jenkins means running multiple stages or tasks at the same time 
instead of one after another to reduce overall pipeline execution time.

✅ Simple Definition
Parallel → “Run multiple stages together”
Improves speed and efficiency of pipeline

✅ Why Use Parallel?
Reduce build time
Execute independent tasks simultaneously
Improve CI/CD performance

👉 Example:
Run tests on multiple environments at once
Build multiple components in parallel


